      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure what \"target level 3\" is, but I\u0027m a bit skeptical that this patch should go upstream.\n\nWhen Android U is released, HAL 1.0 will be eight API levels behind (U would be the ninth). My recollection is that HAL support extends to a maximum of 3+3 for VSR-compliant devices and no further. This puts HAL 1.0-1.2 completely out of the range of things we consider from a maintenance perspective, and I want to make sure that the incentives are in the right place for developers that are building and launching devices.",
